            "image_width": 50,
            "image_border": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<h3>Pay in 3-12 Instalments</h3><p>We prioritise making your life easier, including payment options. You can split payments for most items in our catalog into interest-free instalments with just a few clicks—simple and secure. For full payment terms, visit our dedicated page.</p>",
            "link_text": "Payment information",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/payment",
