        },
        "item_Xj6AC": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/icons8-delivery-time.svg",
            "image_width": 50,
            "image_border": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title": "",
            "content": "<h3>90 Days Hassle-Free Returns</h3><p>It's natural to have doubts—it's part of the process. You might wonder if the furniture that looks perfect on our website will suit your home. What if you change your mind? Rest assured, contact us within 90 days and we'll take back the furniture hassle-free. We cover all costs, offering you a risk-free trial.</p>",
